WEBVTT

00:04:28.756 --> 00:04:31.436
in what I like to call the race of life.

00:04:31.716 --> 00:04:33.756
And it's because of that head start,

00:04:33.796 --> 00:04:37.276
not just because we worked
extra, extra hard,

00:04:37.316 --> 00:04:39.636
that they'll always be miles ahead,

00:04:39.676 --> 00:04:43.796
even if all the participants
are running at the same speed

00:04:43.796 --> 00:04:45.316
and with the same ability.

00:04:45.356 --> 00:04:48.876
So that's code for the same
amount to merits,

00:04:48.916 --> 00:04:50.916
or in this case,

00:04:50.956 --> 00:04:53.276
running the same distance.

00:04:54.636 --> 00:04:55.876
Now, it's well documented

00:04:55.876 --> 00:04:59.876
that women of minority groups
face even greater hurdles,

00:04:59.876 --> 00:05:01.476
as you can see.